      <title>The US Navy's Hanwha Deal Is Just a Drop in the Ocean</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-08/the-us-navy-s-hanwha-deal-is-just-a-drop-in-the-ocean</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">7154c84888c8d5525b753a68</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:00:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Seoul pledged a year ago to spend $150 billion on revitalizing America’s maritime industry in exchange for a trade pact with President Donald Trump. But with the first shipbuilding contract between South Korea’s Hanwha Group and the US Navy worth a fraction of that sum, it’s Washington’s turn to take the lead to ensure that promise is fulfilled.</description>
